### Providing a Default

If some cell values do not match any case, they remain unchanged by default. You can set a fallback
value with the `default=` argument.

::: {#ea904dcc .cell execution_count=8}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(
    gt_tbl
    .text_case_match(
        ("DONE", "Complete"),
        default="Other",
        locations=loc.body(columns="status")
    )
)
```

